<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Clé d'Or — Conciergerie Airbnb Premium</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@300;400;500&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  :root {
    --gold: #B8860B;
    --gold-light: #D4A017;
    --gold-pale: #F5E7B2;
    --dark: #FFFFFF;
    --dark-2: #F8F5EE;
    --dark-3: #F2EDE0;
    --cream: #111111;
    --cream-soft: #222222;
    --text-muted: #444444;
    --text-body: #333333;
    --white: #111111;
  }

*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
background: var(–dark);
color: var(–cream);
font-family: ‘DM Sans’, sans-serif;
font-weight: 400;
line-height: 1.6;
overflow-x: hidden;
}

/* ─── NAV ─── */
nav {
position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
padding: 1.4rem 4rem;
background: rgba(12,11,9,0.92);
backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.08);
}
.logo {
font-family: ‘Playfair Display’, serif;
font-size: 1.5rem;
letter-spacing: 0.04em;
color: var(–gold);
display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem;
}
.logo-key { font-size: 1.4rem; }
.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2.5rem; list-style: none; }
.nav-links a {
color: var(–cream-soft); text-decoration: none;
font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
transition: color 0.3s;
}
.nav-links a:hover { color: var(–gold); }
.nav-cta {
background: transparent;
border: 1px solid var(–gold);
color: var(–gold);
padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
font-family: ‘DM Sans’, sans-serif;
font-size: 0.82rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s;
}
.nav-cta:hover { background: var(–gold); color: var(–dark); }

/* ─── HERO ─── */
#hero {
min-height: 100vh;
display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
text-align: center;
padding: 8rem 2rem 4rem;
position: relative;
overflow: hidden;
}
.hero-bg {
position: absolute; inset: 0;
background:
radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 40%, rgba(201,162,39,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%),
radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 40% at 20% 70%, rgba(201,162,39,0.04) 0%, transparent 60%),
radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 50% at 80% 20%, rgba(201,162,39,0.03) 0%, transparent 60%);
}
.hero-lines {
position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;
background-image:
linear-gradient(rgba(201,162,39,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(201,162,39,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
background-size: 80px 80px;
mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 70% at 50% 50%, black 20%, transparent 80%);
}

.hero-badge {
display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.35);
padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–gold); margin-bottom: 2rem;
animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease both;
}
.hero-badge::before, .hero-badge::after {
content: ‘’; width: 20px; height: 1px; background: var(–gold); opacity: 0.5;
}

h1 {
font-family: ‘Playfair Display’, serif;
font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6.5rem);
font-weight: 700;
line-height: 1.05;
letter-spacing: -0.01em;
animation: fadeUp 0.9s 0.15s ease both;
}
h1 em {
font-style: italic;
background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(–gold) 0%, var(–gold-light) 50%, var(–gold) 100%);
-webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
background-clip: text;
}
.hero-sub {
font-family: ‘Cormorant Garamond’, serif;
font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.5vw, 1.55rem);
color: var(–cream-soft);
max-width: 560px;
line-height: 1.65;
margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
animation: fadeUp 1s 0.3s ease both;
}
.hero-actions {
display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;
margin-top: 2.8rem;
animation: fadeUp 1s 0.45s ease both;
}
.btn-primary {
background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(–gold) 0%, var(–gold-light) 100%);
color: var(–dark); border: none;
padding: 1rem 2.4rem;
font-family: ‘DM Sans’, sans-serif;
font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.35s;
position: relative; overflow: hidden;
}
.btn-primary::after {
content: ‘’; position: absolute; inset: 0;
background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
transform: translateX(-100%); transition: transform 0.4s;
}
.btn-primary:hover::after { transform: translateX(0); }
.btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(201,162,39,0.3); }

.btn-secondary {
background: transparent; border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.4);
color: var(–cream); padding: 1rem 2.4rem;
font-family: ‘DM Sans’, sans-serif;
font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s;
}
.btn-secondary:hover { border-color: var(–gold); color: var(–gold); }

.hero-scroll {
position: absolute; bottom: 2.5rem; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;
font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–text-muted);
animation: fadeUp 1s 0.8s ease both;
}
.scroll-line {
width: 1px; height: 50px;
background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(–gold), transparent);
animation: scrollPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
}

/* ─── CHIFFRES ─── */
#stats {
padding: 5rem 4rem;
border-top: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.12);
border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.12);
background: var(–dark-2);
}
.stats-grid {
max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
gap: 2rem; text-align: center;
}
.stat-item { padding: 1rem; }
.stat-num {
font-family: ‘Playfair Display’, serif;
font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
color: var(–gold); line-height: 1;
background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(–gold), var(–gold-light));
-webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
background-clip: text;
}
.stat-label {
font-size: 0.82rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–text-body); margin-top: 0.6rem; line-height: 1.5;
}

/* ─── SECTION TITLES ─── */
.section-tag {
font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–gold); margin-bottom: 1rem;
display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem;
}
.section-tag::before {
content: ‘’; width: 30px; height: 1px; background: var(–gold);
}
.section-title {
font-family: ‘Playfair Display’, serif;
font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 600;
}
.section-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(–gold); }

/* ─── COMMENT ÇA MARCHE ─── */
#how {
padding: 8rem 4rem;
max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;
}
.how-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 5rem; }
.how-grid {
display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
gap: 0; position: relative;
}
.how-grid::before {
content: ‘’; position: absolute;
top: 2.9rem; left: 22%; right: 22%;
height: 1px;
background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, rgba(201,162,39,0.25), rgba(201,162,39,0.25), transparent);
}
.step {
padding: 0 2.5rem;
text-align: center;
position: relative;
}
.step + .step::before {
content: ‘’; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0;
width: 1px;
background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, rgba(201,162,39,0.15), transparent);
}
.step-num {
width: 60px; height: 60px;
border: 1px solid var(–gold);
display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
margin: 0 auto 2rem;
font-family: ‘Playfair Display’, serif;
font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(–gold);
position: relative;
transition: all 0.4s;
}
.step-num::before {
content: ‘’; position: absolute; inset: -4px;
border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.2);
transition: all 0.4s;
}
.step:hover .step-num {
background: var(–gold); color: var(–dark);
box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(201,162,39,0.25);
}
.step h3 {
font-family: ‘Playfair Display’, serif;
font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.9rem; color: var(–cream);
}
.step p { font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.75; color: var(–text-body); }

/* ─── AVANTAGES ─── */
#avantages {
padding: 8rem 4rem;
background: var(–dark-2);
position: relative; overflow: hidden;
}
#avantages::before {
content: ‘’; position: absolute; right: -200px; top: -200px;
width: 600px; height: 600px;
border-radius: 50%;
background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(201,162,39,0.06) 0%, transparent 70%);
}
.avantages-inner {
max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;
display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
gap: 6rem; align-items: center;
}
.avantages-text .section-tag { justify-content: flex-start; }
.avantages-list {
list-style: none; margin-top: 2.5rem;
display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.2rem;
}
.avantages-list li {
display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem;
padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.1);
background: rgba(201,162,39,0.02);
transition: all 0.3s;
}
.avantages-list li:hover {
border-color: rgba(201,162,39,0.3);
background: rgba(201,162,39,0.05);
transform: translateX(4px);
}
.av-icon {
font-size: 1.3rem; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 0.1rem;
}
.av-content h4 {
font-family: ‘Playfair Display’, serif;
font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; color: var(–cream);
}
.av-content p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(–text-body); line-height: 1.7; }

.avantages-visual {
position: relative;
padding: 0 2rem 4rem 0;
}
.revenue-card {
background: var(–dark-3);
border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.2);
padding: 2.5rem;
position: relative;
}
.revenue-card::before {
content: ‘’; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
height: 2px;
background: linear-gradient(to right, var(–gold), var(–gold-light), var(–gold));
}
.rc-label { font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(–text-body); }
.rc-amount {
font-family: ‘Playfair Display’, serif;
font-size: 3.5rem; color: var(–gold); line-height: 1.1;
margin: 0.5rem 0 0.2rem;
}
.rc-sub { font-size: 0.84rem; color: var(–text-body); }
.rc-divider { width: 100%; height: 1px; background: rgba(201,162,39,0.15); margin: 1.5rem 0; }
.rc-rows { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
.rc-row {
display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
}
.rc-row-label { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(–text-body); }
.rc-row-val { font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(–cream); }
.rc-row-val.gold { color: var(–gold); }
.floating-badge {
position: absolute; bottom: -3rem; right: -1.2rem;
background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(–gold), var(–gold-light));
color: #fff;
padding: 0.9rem 1.3rem;
font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase;
text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(180,130,0,0.25);
}
.floating-badge strong {
display: block; font-family: ‘Playfair Display’, serif;
font-size: 1.7rem; letter-spacing: 0; line-height: 1.1;
}

/* ─── PROPRIÉTÉS ─── */
#proprietes {
padding: 8rem 4rem;
max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;
text-align: center;
}
.prop-grid {
display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 4rem;
}
.prop-card {
border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.15);
padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
transition: all 0.4s;
cursor: default;
position: relative; overflow: hidden;
}
.prop-card::before {
content: ‘’; position: absolute; inset: 0;
background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(201,162,39,0.05) 0%, transparent 60%);
opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.4s;
}
.prop-card:hover { border-color: var(–gold); transform: translateY(-6px); box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }
.prop-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
.prop-icon { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; display: block; }
.prop-card h3 {
font-family: ‘Playfair Display’, serif;
font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.7rem; color: var(–cream);
}
.prop-card p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(–text-body); line-height: 1.7; }

/* ─── COMMISSION ─── */
#commission {
padding: 8rem 4rem;
background: var(–dark-2);
}
.commission-inner {
max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;
}
.commission-visual {
margin: 4rem 0;
display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 0;
}
.pie-wrap { position: relative; width: 220px; height: 220px; flex-shrink: 0; }
.pie-wrap svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
.pie-label {
position: absolute; inset: 0;
display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
font-family: ‘Playfair Display’, serif;
}
.pie-label span { font-size: 2.5rem; color: var(–gold); line-height: 1; }
.pie-label small { font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(–text-muted); }
.commission-legend {
display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;
margin-left: 3rem; text-align: left;
}
.legend-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; }
.legend-dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }
.legend-text { font-size: 0.88rem; }
.legend-text strong { display: block; color: var(–cream); font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
.legend-text span { color: var(–text-body); font-size: 0.82rem; }

.commission-note {
font-family: ‘Cormorant Garamond’, serif;
font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(–cream-soft); line-height: 1.7;
margin-top: 2rem; font-style: italic;
padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
border-left: 2px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.4);
text-align: left;
max-width: 600px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;
}

/* ─── TEMOIGNAGES ─── */
#temoignages {
padding: 8rem 4rem;
max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
text-align: center;
}
.temo-grid {
display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
gap: 2rem; margin-top: 4rem;
}
.temo-card {
border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.12);
padding: 2.5rem;
text-align: left;
transition: all 0.3s;
background: rgba(201,162,39,0.01);
}
.temo-card:hover { border-color: rgba(201,162,39,0.3); background: rgba(201,162,39,0.04); }
.temo-stars { color: var(–gold); font-size: 0.9rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.temo-text {
font-family: ‘Cormorant Garamond’, serif;
font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.75; color: var(–cream);
font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}
.temo-author { font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(–text-body); }
.temo-author strong { color: var(–gold); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.2rem; font-size: 0.85rem; }

/* ─── CTA ─── */
#contact {
padding: 8rem 4rem;
background:
radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 70% at 50% 50%, rgba(201,162,39,0.07) 0%, transparent 70%),
var(–dark-3);
position: relative; overflow: hidden;
text-align: center;
}
#contact::before, #contact::after {
content: ‘’; position: absolute;
width: 300px; height: 1px;
background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, var(–gold), transparent);
opacity: 0.3;
left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
}
#contact::before { top: 0; }
#contact::after { bottom: 0; }
.contact-inner { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; }
.contact-inner h2 {
font-family: ‘Playfair Display’, serif;
font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
line-height: 1.15; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
}
.contact-inner h2 em { font-style: italic; color: var(–gold); }
.contact-inner p {
font-family: ‘Cormorant Garamond’, serif;
font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(–cream-soft); margin-bottom: 3rem; line-height: 1.6;
}
.contact-form {
display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;
}
.form-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
.form-input {
background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.2);
color: var(–cream);
padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
font-family: ‘DM Sans’, sans-serif;
font-size: 0.85rem;
width: 100%;
outline: none;
transition: border-color 0.3s;
}
.form-input::placeholder { color: var(–text-muted); }
.form-input:focus { border-color: var(–gold); }
.form-select {
background: rgba(12,11,9,0.9);
border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.2);
color: var(–text-muted);
padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
font-family: ‘DM Sans’, sans-serif;
font-size: 0.85rem;
width: 100%; outline: none;
cursor: pointer; appearance: none;
transition: border-color 0.3s;
}
.form-select:focus { border-color: var(–gold); color: var(–cream); }
.btn-submit {
background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(–gold), var(–gold-light));
color: var(–dark); border: none;
padding: 1.1rem; width: 100%;
font-family: ‘DM Sans’, sans-serif;
font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;
cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.35s;
margin-top: 0.5rem;
}
.btn-submit:hover { opacity: 0.9; transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(201,162,39,0.3); }

/* ─── FOOTER ─── */
footer {
padding: 3rem 4rem;
border-top: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.1);
display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
background: var(–dark);
}
.footer-logo {
font-family: ‘Playfair Display’, serif;
color: var(–gold); font-size: 1.1rem;
}
.footer-text { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(–text-body); }
.footer-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; list-style: none; }
.footer-links a { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(–text-body); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.3s; }
.footer-links a:hover { color: var(–gold); }

/* ─── KEYFRAMES ─── */
@keyframes fadeUp {
from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}
@keyframes scrollPulse {
0%, 100% { transform: scaleY(1); opacity: 0.6; }
50% { transform: scaleY(0.6); opacity: 1; }
}

/* ─── REVEAL ON SCROLL ─── */
.reveal {
opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px);
transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;
}
.reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

/* ─── RESPONSIVE ─── */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
nav { padding: 1.2rem 2rem; }
.nav-links { display: none; }
#how, #proprietes, #temoignages, #contact { padding: 5rem 2rem; }
#avantages, #commission, #stats { padding: 5rem 2rem; }
.how-grid, .prop-grid, .temo-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
.how-grid::before { display: none; }
.stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
.avantages-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
.commission-visual { flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem; }
.commission-legend { margin-left: 0; }
.form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; text-align: center; }
}
</style>

</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->

<nav>
  <div class="logo">
    <span class="logo-key">🗝</span> Clé d'Or
  </div>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#how">Comment ça marche</a></li>
    <li><a href="#avantages">Avantages</a></li>
    <li><a href="#commission">Tarifs</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
  </ul>
  <button class="nav-cta" onclick="document.getElementById('contact').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">Être rappelé</button>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->

<section id="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>
  <div class="hero-lines"></div>
  <div class="hero-badge">Conciergerie Airbnb Premium</div>
  <h1>Votre bien devient<br>une <em>source d'or</em></h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Transformez votre appartement, maison ou villa en location courte durée performante. On s'occupe de tout — vous encaissez.</p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <button class="btn-primary" onclick="document.getElementById('contact').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">Estimer mes revenus</button>
    <button class="btn-secondary" onclick="document.getElementById('how').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">Découvrir le concept</button>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-scroll">
    <div class="scroll-line"></div>
    <span>Découvrir</span>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STATS -->

<section id="stats">
  <div class="stats-grid">
    <div class="stat-item reveal">
      <div class="stat-num">+40%</div>
