          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="legend-item">
          <div class="legend-dot" style="background:rgba(201,162,39,0.3)"></div>
          <div class="legend-text">
            <strong>15% — Clé d'Or</strong>
            <span>Gestion, ménage, réservations, support</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="commission-note reveal">
